---
interface Props { market: 'usa' | 'canada'; }
const { market } = Astro.props;
const isUS = market === 'usa';
const steps = [
  { title: 'Discover & define', text: 'Review the existing website, business goals and critical journeys. Agree pages, integrations, content responsibilities and acceptance criteria.' },
  { title: 'Build with review points', text: 'Work through design and implementation in an agreed preview environment. Record decisions and approvals rather than relying on continuous local-hour availability.' },
  { title: 'Test & prepare launch', text: 'Check the scoped devices, forms, commerce workflows and accessibility requirements. Document migration redirects, access and rollback responsibilities where relevant.' },
  { title: 'Hand over & support', text: 'Deliver the agreed documentation and access. Source-code rights, custom IP, payment milestones, hosting, licences and maintenance are specified in the signed proposal.' },
];
---
<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby={`${market}-delivery-title`}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--accent)]">From first conversation to a maintainable handover</p>
        <h2 id={`${market}-delivery-title`} class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-bold">A clear process across time zones.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">{isUS ? 'US morning and India evening calls can be scheduled by your actual time zone, including daylight-saving changes.' : 'Canadian morning and India evening reviews can be planned by province and time zone, including daylight-saving changes.'} Meeting frequency, response windows and approval owners are agreed at kickoff. Delivery is from India; no local {isUS ? 'US' : 'Canadian'} office is implied.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">Ask for one-time development and recurring costs separately. The quotation identifies currency, taxes where applicable, third-party fees, exclusions and ongoing support. A smaller assessment can define the scope before a rebuild is proposed.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/get-quote/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--accent)] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-[var(--bg)]">{isUS ? 'Scope my US project' : 'Scope my Canadian project'} <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-2">→</span></a>
          <a href="/schedule-consultation/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold">Discuss the requirements</a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-6 text-[var(--text-muted)]">Share a business summary, not passwords or customer records. Each enquiry form explains its own privacy notice. An initial free website review is not a complete WCAG conformance audit.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {steps.map((step, index) => <li class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-6">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--accent)]">0{index + 1}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-heading text-lg font-bold">{step.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">{step.text}</p>
        </li>)}
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">{isUS ? 'Accessibility work is scoped against an agreed technical standard and tested journeys. ADA Title II, Title III and federal procurement requirements are not interchangeable; your legal adviser should confirm what applies.' : 'Canadian requirements vary by organisation and jurisdiction. Ontario/AODA, federal requirements and a particular procurement standard should not be treated as interchangeable. French translation, linguistic review and legal approval are separate unless expressly included.'} No certification, legal outcome or universal compliance is promised.</p>
  </div>
</section>
